<title>USA: Silicon Graphics wins $35 million contract.</title>
<headline>Silicon Graphics wins $35 million contract.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Silicon Graphics Inc on Tuesday announced a contract valued at a potential $35 million to sell computers and peripherals to the U.S. Department of Defense Intelligence Information Systems group.</p>
<p>The deal was awarded through subcontractor Cordant/Tracor Information Systems Co, and it calls for indefinite delivery dates, Silicon Graphics said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shares of Silicon Graphics were up 1/8 at 17-1/4 by mid-afternoon.</p>
</text>
